#: .\templates\olretail\seller_subscription.html:17
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Free accounts can list up to %(free_limit)s products, and each one is "
"reviewed by an admin before it goes live. Subscribers can list without limit"
" and publish instantly — no approval wait."
msgstr ""
"Akun gratis dapat mendaftarkan hingga %(free_limit)s produk, dan masing-"
"masing ditinjau admin sebelum tayang. Pelanggan dapat mendaftarkan tanpa "
"batas dan langsung terbit — tanpa menunggu persetujuan."

